{"seq":1,"slug":"climate-change","title":"高二地理 — 气候变化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/global-issues/climate-change","wordCount":2159,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二地理-气候变化\">高二地理 — 气候变化</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>全球气候变化是当今人类面临的最严峻的环境挑战之一。工业革命以来，大气中二氧化碳浓度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>280</mn><mtext>ppm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">280\\text{ppm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">280</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ppm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 上升到2023年的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>421</mn><mtext>ppm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">421\\text{ppm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">421</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ppm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，全球平均气温较工业化前已升高约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>。气候变化不仅是自然科学问题，更涉及经济发展模式、国际政治博弈和社会公平等多维度议题。理解气候变化的科学机制、影响评估和应对策略，是高中地理的重要素养目标。</p>\n<p>温室效应基本参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温室气体</th>\n<th>化学式</th>\n<th>贡献占比（约）</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n<th>大气寿命</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二氧化碳</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>65</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">65\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>化石燃料燃烧、毁林</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\text{-}1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甲烷</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>畜牧业、水稻、天然气泄漏</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氧化亚氮</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>N</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{N}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>农业施肥、工业过程</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>114</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 114</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">114</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含氟气体</td>\n<td>HFCs等</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>制冷剂、工业过程</td>\n<td>数百至数千年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-温室效应的科学原理\">一、温室效应的科学原理</h3><p>地球接收太阳短波辐射后被地面吸收并加热，地面以长波辐射的形式向外释放能量。大气中的温室气体能够吸收并重新辐射这些长波辐射，使部分热量被&quot;困&quot;在大气层内，从而维持地球表面的温暖——这就是温室效应。</p>\n<p>没有温室效应，地球表面平均温度将从现在的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-18°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">18°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，生命将无法存在。因此问题的本质不是温室效应本身，而是人类活动导致温室气体浓度<strong>异常升高</strong>，使温室效应增强，引发全球变暖。</p>\n<p><strong>正反馈机制</strong>加速了变暖进程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>冰雪融化 → 反射率降低 → 吸收更多太阳辐射 → 进一步升温</li>\n<li>永久冻土解冻 → 释放封存的甲烷 → 增强温室效应</li>\n<li>海水升温 → 溶解的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 释放到大气 → 浓度进一步上升</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-全球气候变化的证据\">二、全球气候变化的证据</h3><p>科学家通过多种手段获取气候变化的证据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据类型</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>揭示的信息</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>器测记录</td>\n<td>气象站、卫星</td>\n<td>近150年全球气温持续上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰芯记录</td>\n<td>南极/格陵兰冰盖钻探</td>\n<td>过去80万年 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度与温度的对应关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树木年轮</td>\n<td>古树横截面分析</td>\n<td>反映过去数百至数千年的温度和降水变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海平面观测</td>\n<td>验潮站、卫星测高</td>\n<td>20世纪全球海平面上升约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.2\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰川退缩</td>\n<td>卫星遥感对比</td>\n<td>全球山地冰川体积持续减小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>IPCC</strong>（政府间气候变化专门委员会）是评估气候变化科学的权威机构。其第六次评估报告（AR6, 2021-2023）指出：人类活动&quot;毫无疑问地&quot;导致了全球变暖，且未来升温幅度取决于碳排放路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-气候变化的影响\">三、气候变化的影响</h3><p><strong>对自然系统的影响</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>海平面上升：热膨胀和冰川融化导致，21世纪末可能上升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1.0</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3\\text{-}1.0\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。太平洋岛国图瓦卢面临&quot;灭顶&quot;之灾。</li>\n<li>极端天气增多：热浪、暴雨、干旱的频率和强度增大</li>\n<li>生态系统迁移：物种向高纬度和高海拔迁移，珊瑚白化面积扩大</li>\n<li>冻土退化：北半球永久冻土面积缩小，释放碳储量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对人类社会的影响</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>具体影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>农业</td>\n<td>中高纬度种植带北移，低纬度干旱加剧，粮食产量波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水资源</td>\n<td>冰川萎缩影响下游供水，干旱区水资源更加紧张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>高温热浪致死增加，热带疾病（登革热、疟疾）向中纬度扩散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海岸带</td>\n<td>风暴潮加剧，沿海低地被淹，盐水入侵地下淡水层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济</td>\n<td>气候灾害损失增加，保险成本上升，部分行业（滑雪旅游等）萎缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>对中国的特殊影响</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>青藏高原冰川退缩威胁长江、黄河上游水源</li>\n<li>华北干旱加剧与华南暴雨增多并存</li>\n<li>沿海城市（上海、广州、天津）面临海平面上升和风暴潮风险</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-应对气候变化的国际机制\">四、应对气候变化的国际机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>《联合国气候变化框架公约》</td>\n<td>1992</td>\n<td>确立&quot;共同但有区别的责任&quot;原则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>《京都议定书》</td>\n<td>1997</td>\n<td>发达国家承担强制减排义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>《巴黎协定》</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>将升温控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以内，努力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>；各国自主贡献（NDC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COP26-COP28</td>\n<td>2021-2023</td>\n<td>逐步减少化石燃料，建立损失与损害基金</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;共同但有区别的责任&quot;原则</strong>：发达国家在历史上排放了大量温室气体，应承担更大的减排责任并向发展中国家提供资金和技术支持。这一原则是国际气候谈判中发展中国家的核心诉求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-减缓与适应策略\">五、减缓与适应策略</h3><p><strong>减缓</strong>（Mitigation）：减少温室气体排放和增加碳汇。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>能源结构转型：从化石能源转向可再生能源（太阳能、风能、水能）</li>\n<li>碳捕集与封存（CCS）：将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从工业排放中分离并封存于地下</li>\n<li>碳交易市场：通过市场机制激励企业减排（欧盟碳市场ETS是全球最大的碳交易体系）</li>\n<li>植树造林：增加陆地碳汇</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适应</strong>（Adaptation）：调整社会系统以降低气候变化的不利影响。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>建设海堤和防洪设施</li>\n<li>培育耐旱耐盐作物品种</li>\n<li>完善极端天气预警系统</li>\n<li>调整城市规划（增加绿地、透水铺装）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>中国的&quot;双碳&quot;目标</strong>：2030年前碳达峰、2060年前碳中和。这意味着中国的碳排放将在2030年左右达到峰值后开始下降，并在2060年实现排放量与吸收量的平衡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-气候变化中的争议与思辨\">六、气候变化中的争议与思辨</h3><p>尽管科学界对人为气候变化已有高度共识（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>97</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;97\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">97%</span></span></span></span></span> 的气候科学家认同），但公共讨论中仍存在争议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;气候变暖是自然周期还是人为因素？&quot;——冰芯数据显示当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 浓度远超过去80万年的自然波动范围</li>\n<li>&quot;减排会阻碍经济发展吗？&quot;——可再生能源成本已大幅下降，绿色转型可以创造新的经济增长点</li>\n<li>&quot;发展中国家是否应该与发达国家承担同等责任？&quot;——历史排放量和人均排放量差异巨大</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>画出温室效应的能量收支示意图，标注太阳短波辐射、地面长波辐射和大气逆辐射。</li>\n<li>分析为什么北极地区的升温速度是全球平均水平的2-3倍（北极放大效应）。</li>\n<li>假设全球海平面上升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>，哪些国家和地区将受到最严重的影响？</li>\n<li>比较&quot;减缓&quot;与&quot;适应&quot;两种策略的特点，为一个热带低地岛国设计气候变化应对方案。</li>\n<li>辩论题：&quot;发展中国家应该优先发展经济还是优先减排？&quot;请从公平性和紧迫性两个角度分析。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>IPCC第六次评估报告（AR6）的决策者摘要（SPM）是了解气候变化最新科学认知的权威文件，约30页，建议通读。</li>\n<li>NASA气候变化网站（climate.nasa.gov）提供实时更新的全球气温、海冰面积、海平面等可视化数据。</li>\n<li>中国的碳达峰碳中和（&quot;双碳&quot;）政策体系值得关注，包括《2030年前碳达峰行动方案》等系列文件。</li>\n<li>纪录片《难以忽视的真相》（2006）和《追冰》（2012）以影像方式直观展现了气候变化的影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>全球气候变化是温室效应增强的结果，其科学机制清晰、证据充分。气候变化对自然生态和人类社会的影响广泛而深远，从海平面上升到极端天气增多，从粮食安全到公共健康均受波及。应对气候变化需要全球合作，《巴黎协定》确立了&quot;控温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，力争 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>&quot;的目标框架。中国作为最大的发展中国家和碳排放国，&quot;双碳&quot;目标的提出体现了大国担当，也标志着经济发展模式的深刻转型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二地理 — 气候变化","id":"高二地理-气候变化"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、温室效应的科学原理","id":"一-温室效应的科学原理"},{"level":3,"text":"二、全球气候变化的证据","id":"二-全球气候变化的证据"},{"level":3,"text":"三、气候变化的影响","id":"三-气候变化的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"四、应对气候变化的国际机制","id":"四-应对气候变化的国际机制"},{"level":3,"text":"五、减缓与适应策略","id":"五-减缓与适应策略"},{"level":3,"text":"六、气候变化中的争议与思辨","id":"六-气候变化中的争议与思辨"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二地理 — 区域规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/regional-development/regional-planning"},"next":{"title":"高二地理 — 资源危机","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/global-issues/resource-crisis"}}